    <listOfReactions>
      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_5633460" metaid="metaid_31" name="MDM2 binds TP53" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The N-terminal portion of MDM2 binds the N-terminal transactivation domain of TP53 (p53) and inhibits transcriptional transactivation by TP53 (Momand et al. 1992, Oliner et al. 1992, Oliner et al. 1993, Chen et al. 1993).</p>
        </notes>
