      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_264458" metaid="metaid_33" name="Proteasome mediated degradation of COP1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Autoubiquitinated COP1 is degraded by the proteasome. The number of ubiquitin molecules shown in this reaction is arbitrarily set at 4. (Dornan et al., 2006).</p>
