      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_264435" metaid="metaid_37" name="Dissociation of the COP1-p53 complex" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ATM-dependent phosphorylation of COP1 on Ser(387) results in disruption of the COP1-p53 complex (Dornan et al., 2006)</p>
