      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_6804955" metaid="metaid_41" name="ATM phosphorylates MDM2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ATM phosphorylates MDM2 on three serine residues (S386, S395, S407) and one threonine residue (T419) in vicinity to the RING domain. ATM-mediated phosphorylation of MDM2 in response to DNA damage (DNA double strand breaks) prevents MDM2 dimerization, binding of TP53 (p53) and MDM2-mediated ubiquitination of TP53 (Cheng et al. 2009, Cheng et al. 2011).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
