      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_6793685" metaid="metaid_42" name="Ubiquitinated TP53 translocates to the cytosol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Upon MDM2-mediated ubiquitination, TP53 is exported from the nucleus to the cytosol. TP53 nuclear export requires the nuclear export sequence (NES) of TP53, but not the NES of MDM2 (Boyd et al. 2000. Geyer et al. 2000).</p>
        </notes>
