      <reaction compartment="compartment_13231" fast="false" id="reaction_264418" metaid="metaid_43" name="Translocation of COP1 from the nucleus to the cytoplasm" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Ionizing radiation results in an ATM-dependent movement of COP1 from the nucleus to the cytoplasm (Dornan et al., 2006).</p>
        </notes>
