      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_349444" metaid="metaid_45" name="Phosphorylation of COP1 at Ser-387  by ATM" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ATM phosphorylates COP1 on Ser387 in response to DNA damage (Dornan et al., 2006).</p>
